          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you ship overseas?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we ship all over the world. Shipping costs will apply, and will be added at checkout. We run discounts and promotions all year, so stay tuned for exclusive deals.</p>"
